[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0012","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0859","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 组件在处理内存对象时存在特权提升漏洞，由于内存对象处理逻辑缺陷，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意调用触发内存对象处理逻辑错误，从而将低权限提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及 Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需低权限（PR:L）且无需用户交互（UI:N），机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高（C:H/I:H/A:H）。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），确有在野利用案例，攻击者可结合其他漏洞实现远程代码执行。Microsoft 已于 2019 年 4 月补丁日发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0859"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T21:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:03Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 2019 年 4 月补丁日发布的安全更新：Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4493472，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4493441，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 安装 KB4493474，Windows 10 1703 安装 KB4493464，Windows 10 1709 安装 KB4493448，Windows 10 1803 安装 KB4493467，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4493509。若暂无法打补丁，可启用 Windows Defender Exploit Guard 的任意代码执行防护（ACG/CFG）并禁用不受信字体解析作为临时缓解，同时限制本地低权限用户登录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0859","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0859","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0859.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2019/CVE-2019-0859.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-0859/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-0859/README_EN.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0859.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0859.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0685.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0859.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0859.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0803.md","https://github.com/Sheisback/CVE-2019-0859-1day-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0055","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0841","title":"微软 Windows AppX 部署服务硬链接权限提升漏洞","description":"这是一个与 Windows AppX 部署服务 (AppXSVC) 中硬链接处理不当相关的权限提升漏洞。当 AppXSVC 处理硬链接时未能正确验证时，攻击者能够利用这个缺陷来提升系统权限。该漏洞源于对硬链接的未授权访问和操作，攻击者只需要具备最低限度的系统权限即可触发。通过精心构造的硬链接，攻击者可以绕过安全机制，获取更高的系统访问权限，包括用户、管理员或服务权限，具体提升程度取决于系统配置和当前服务账户的权限。该漏洞影响所有安装了 Windows AppX 部署服务的 Windows 版本，尤其在企业环境中，由于大量使用应用商店应用，可能导致更严重的权限提升风险。攻击者可以利用此漏洞破坏系统完整性，获取敏感信息或进一步执行恶意操作。该漏洞的攻击条件包括：攻击者必须在系统上拥有最低限度的本地访问权限，具备识别和利用硬链接弱点的能力。通过发送特制的硬链接请求到 AppXSVC 服务，攻击者可以触发权限提升过程。通常情况下，攻击者会先收集系统的服务账户信息，找到相关的硬链接路径和权限控制点，然后通过精心构造的硬链接引发异常路径解析，最终导致系统以更高的权限执行攻击者的恶意代码。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 7.8，等级为 HIGH，表明它是一个中等复杂的漏洞，需要一定的攻击技能，但一旦成功，可能会给系统带来严重的后果。微软已经在 2019 年的补丁中修复了这个漏洞，建议所有 Windows 用户及时更新系统。相关的安全补丁和详细的技术信息可以在微软安全更新目录中找到。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0841"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:01Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 4 月安全更新（KB4493470 / KB4493472 / KB4493441 等，对应 Windows 10 版本），或升级至 Windows 10 版本 1809（内部版本 17763）及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可暂时禁用 AppX Deployment Service (AppXSVC) 服务作为临时缓解：以管理员身份运行 `sc config AppXSvc start= disabled` 并重启服务或重启系统，但这会影响 UWP 应用安装/更新功能，打补丁后务必恢复为自动启动（`sc config AppXSvc start= auto`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152463/Microsoft-Windows-AppX-Deployment-Service-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153009/Internet-Explorer-JavaScript-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153114/Microsoft-Windows-AppX-Deployment-Service-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153215/Microsoft-Windows-AppX-Deployment-Service-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153642/AppXSvc-Hard-Link-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46683/","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-19-360/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47128","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0841.md","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-0841.cs","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0841.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0841.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0841.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0796.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0805.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0730.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0731.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0836.md","https://github.com/rogue-kdc/CVE-2019-0841","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2019-0841-BYPASS","https://github.com/likekabin/CVE-2019-0841","https://github.com/mappl3/CVE-2019-0841"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0033","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0803","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 内核组件在处理内存对象时存在特权提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意调用触发内存对象处理逻辑错误，从低权限提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及 Server 2008 R2/2012/2016/2019 等版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地、低攻击复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互，成功利用可导致系统完全被攻陷（机密性/完整性/可用性均高影响）。该漏洞已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录，野外存在活跃利用，ExploitDB (46920) 及多个 GitHub 仓库均有公开 PoC/EXP 代码，Microsoft 已于 2019 年 4 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0803"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:56Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2019 年 4 月安全更新（KB4493472、KB4493467、KB4493448 等对应版本补丁），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载对应系统版本补丁（Win7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4493472，Win8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4493467，Win10 1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4493448）。无法立即打补丁时，可通过组策略禁用 Win32k.sys 相关字体解析功能或限制普通用户运行未受信程序作为临时缓解。建议尽快部署补丁并重启系统生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153034/Microsoft-Windows-Win32k-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0803","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0803","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46920","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0803.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/bc8c6ce29bd2d05ce5045727021202d1788770bf/vuln_pocs/cve/CVE-2019-0803/CVE-2019-0803-Win32k Elevation of Privilege Poc.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/bc8c6ce29bd2d05ce5045727021202d1788770bf/vuln_pocs/cve/CVE-2019-0803/CVE-2019-0803/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-0803/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-0803/README_EN.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/df8fba54838c4ae134eb4d9c56a3314b6e7b0e16/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win64/Exploit/CVE-2019-0803.yara","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/05-系统漏洞/Windows/CVE-2019-0803/CVE-2019-0803/README.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2016/CVE-2016-7255.md","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win64/CVE-2019-0803/Exploit_Win64_CVE-2019-0803_A.yar","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation","https://github.com/ExpLife0011/CVE-2019-0803","https://github.com/Iamgublin/CVE-2019-0803"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0022","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0752","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 脚本引擎内存损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 脚本引擎（JScript/Chakra）在处理内存中的对象时存在类型混淆导致的内存损坏漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发脚本引擎内存损坏实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 11（如 Windows 10 1809 版本 17763.316 等），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度高、需用户交互、无需权限，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录，确认存在在野利用。攻击者需诱导受害者访问精心构造的恶意网页触发漏洞，成功利用可在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。Microsoft 已于 2019 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞（CVE-2019-0752 与 CVE-2019-0739、CVE-2019-0753、CVE-2019-0862 为不同漏洞）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0752"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:49Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 4 月安全更新（如 KB4493472 等对应版本补丁），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装对应 IE 累积更新。无法立即打补丁时，建议禁用 Internet Explorer 脚本引擎（通过组策略禁用 Active Scripting）或改用 Edge/Chrome 等现代浏览器作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows 10 1903 或更高版本彻底解决 IE 遗留漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153078/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-Windows-10-1809-17763.316-Memory-Corruption.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0752","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-19-359/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46928","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0752.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2019/CVE-2019-0752.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0752.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0752.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0739.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0753.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0862.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0752.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0752.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/7b8e7e5af5233a2630f933b801f3ed8edf9e12e7/2019/CVE-2019-0752/README.md","https://github.com/edxsh/CVE-2019-0752"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0044","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0808","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 内核组件存在内存对象处理不当的特权提升漏洞。攻击者可在本地执行恶意程序或脚本，通过向 Win32k 子系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，在无需用户交互、仅需低权限账户的前提下，将自身权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别并获得完整的系统控制权。该漏洞影响 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2008 R2、Windows Server 2012 R2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。利用该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露、系统被完全接管等严重后果，Microsoft 已在 2019 年 4 月发布的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0808"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:56Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 4 月安全更新（April 2019 Patch Tuesday），通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载并安装对应操作系统的补丁。Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 R2、Windows Server 2008、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012、Windows Server 2012 R2 用户需安装 KB4493448。Windows 10 用户需安装 KB4493472。如暂时无法打补丁，可临时禁用 Win32k 相关的窗口管理接口以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157616/Microsoft-Windows-NtUserMNDragOver-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0808","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0808","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46604","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0808.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-0808/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-0808/README_EN.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0808.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-5786.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0808.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0808.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0797.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-0808.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0808.json","https://github.com/exodusintel/CVE-2019-0808","https://github.com/ze0r/cve-2019-0808-poc","https://github.com/rakesh143/CVE-2019-0808"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0010","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0797","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 组件存在内存对象处理不当导致的特权提升漏洞（CVE-2019-0797）。该漏洞源于 Win32k.sys 内核驱动程序在处理内存中的对象时未正确验证对象属性，导致本地攻击者可通过构造恶意调用触发内存破坏，从而将权限从低权限用户提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及对应 Server 版本（含 Server 2008 R2/2012/2012 R2/2016/2019），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），机密性/完整性/可用性均高影响（C:H/I:H/A:H）。攻击者需已获得本地低权限访问权限，通过调用特定 Win32k 系统调用（如 NtUserSetWindowLongPtr 等）触发内核对象类型混淆或 Use-After-Free，实现任意代码执行并提权至 SYSTEM。该漏洞与 CVE-2019-0808 为不同漏洞，微软已于 2019 年 4 月补丁日（KB4493472 等）发布补丁修复。已知在野利用样本存在（CISA KEV 目录收录），建议尽快安装对应补丁补丁（KB4493472/KB4493475 等）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0797"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:55Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 4 月安全更新（KB4493470 等对应补丁），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装对应版本补丁（Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4493472，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4493467，Windows 10/Server 2016/2019 安装对应累积更新）。若无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用不必要的 Win32k 系统调用或限制本地用户权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0797","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0797","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0797.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0797.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0797.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0808.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0797.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0797.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0797.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0797.json","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/2759ed8f13ba9e96bfb2bf01f23e6c35e91c879a/Intel Reports/securelist_com/cve-2019-0797-zero-day-vulnerability_89885/link.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0797.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0009","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0703","title":"Microsoft Windows SMB 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Windows SMB 服务器在处理特定 SMB 请求时存在信息泄漏漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 SMB 服务发送特制的恶意请求，触发内存信息泄漏，导致敏感内存信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows SMB 服务组件，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.5（中危），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），需要低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），对机密性影响高（C:H），不影响完整性和可用性。攻击者可利用该漏洞泄露内存敏感信息，辅助后续攻击。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0703"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-09T00:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:43Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 4 月安全更新：Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4493472，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4493509，Windows 10 1803 安装 KB4493464，Windows 10 1709 安装 KB4493441，Windows 10 1703 安装 KB4493474，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 安装 KB4493470。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面封锁 445 端口或禁用 SMBv1 协议作为临时缓解措施，并建议限制 SMB 服务仅对可信网段开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0703","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0703","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0703.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0703.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0703.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0703.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0703.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0703.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/b71fadde1b7e978c5ddefd15cc4442bd1ed5b1e5/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-0703","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0703.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2019/CVE-2019-0703.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6ba74bc52475414675b84b57eb9d6c639a40271d/2019/CVE-2019-0703.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0003","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0211","title":"Apache HTTP Server 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.4.17 至 2.4.38 版本在使用 event、worker 或 prefork 多路处理模块（MPM）时，子进程或线程中执行的代码（包括脚本解释器执行的脚本）可通过操作 scoreboard 共享数据结构，以父进程（通常为 root）的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞仅影响类 Unix 系统，攻击者需要能够在 Web 服务器上下文中执行低权限代码，通过修改 scoreboard 中的特权标志位实现本地权限提升，进而完全控制目标服务器。Apache 官方已在 2.4.39 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0211"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-08T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:07:58Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级到 2.4.39 或更高版本，该版本已修复 scoreboard 操纵导致的权限提升漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在 MPM event、worker 或 prefork 配置中禁用不必要的进程内脚本解释器模块（如 mod_lua、mod_php），限制低权限 Web 子进程对 scoreboard 的写入权限，仅允许 root 用户执行 apache2ctl graceful 以避免与 logrotate 触发竞争条件，并监控 httpd 子进程是否存在异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-04/msg00051.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-04/msg00061.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-04/msg00084.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152386/Apache-2.4.38-Root-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152415/Slackware-Security-Advisory-httpd-Updates.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152441/CARPE-DIEM-Apache-2.4.x-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.4.39","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/04/02/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/07/26/7","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/107666","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2019:0959","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0746","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0980","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:1296","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:1297","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:1543","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/56c2e7cc9deb1c12a843d0dc251ea7fd3e7e80293cde02fcd65286ba%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apach