1.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0211.md","https://github.com/cfreal/exploits/blob/99c490d5fd73b2cff7f954961a78457b78b3851a/CVE-2019-0211-apache/README.md","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/CVE-2019-0211/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-0211.md","https://github.com/Coldwave96/PocLibrary/blob/4bdc069c257f441379e9fd428ac8df7d4f5e9ca9/Library/Linux-local/cve-2019-0211-apache.txt","https://github.com/ozkanbilge/Apache-Exploit-2019","https://github.com/Jeanback1/CVE-2019-0211-exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0003.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0003.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0198","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11001","title":"Reolink 多款IPC摄像头 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Reolink 多款网络摄像头产品（RLC-410W、C1 Pro、C2 Pro、RLC-422W、RLC-511W）固件版本 1.0.227 及之前版本存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。漏洞位于设备的 \"TestEmail\" 测试邮件功能中，经过身份认证的管理员用户可在 addr1 参数中注入 Shell 元字符，利用输入验证缺陷将恶意命令拼接进入系统调用，最终以 root 权限在设备上执行任意操作系统命令。攻击向量为网络远程利用（CVSS 3.1 AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H，评分 7.2 HIGH），需具备管理员登录凭据，无需用户交互。成功利用可导致设备完全沦陷，攻击者可窃取视频流、篡改配置、植入后门或将设备纳入僵尸网络，影响监控系统的机密性、完整性与可用性。官方已发布固件更新修复该漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至最新版本并修改默认弱口令。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11001"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-08T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:12:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Reolink 设备固件到最新版本（≥1.0.228），具体方法是通过设备 Web 界面或官方 APP 进行在线更新；同时关闭设备的 TestEmail 功能或限制仅从可信网络访问；如无法立即更新，建议在路由器层面禁用与设备相关的服务端口，并使用防火墙规则限制对设备的非管理访问，以降低被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mcw0/PoC/blob/master/Reolink-IPC-RCE.py","https://www.vdoo.com/blog/working-with-the-community-%E2%80%93-significant-vulnerabilities-in-reolink-cameras/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11001","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2019/11xxx/CVE-2019-11001.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2019/11xxx/CVE-2019-11001.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11001.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-11001.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-11001.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-11001.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-11001.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-11001.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/5001ca4217db3d7295fef7a3044374cacd839566/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-11001"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0038","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10692","title":"CodeCabin WP Go Maps WordPress 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"WordPress Google Maps 插件（wp-google-maps）7.11.18 之前版本中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，位于 includes/class.rest-api.php 文件的 REST API 端点中。该插件在构建 SELECT 查询语句时未对字段名进行正确过滤和转义，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 REST API 路由 `/wpgmga/v1/markers` 的 `fields` 参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而窃取数据库中敏感信息（如用户凭据）、篡改数据或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10692"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-04-02T18:30:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:11:31Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WP Google Maps 插件升级至 7.11.18 或更高版本（该版本已修复 REST API 未对字段名进行过滤导致的 SQL 注入问题），可在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面点击更新，或从插件官网下载最新版手动上传覆盖安装。升级完成后在「设置 → 固定链接」中点击保存以刷新重写规则，并清除 WordPress 及 CDN 缓存。若暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或安全插件拦截包含危险 SQL 关键字的 REST API 请求，同时建议在服务器上限制 wp-google-maps REST 接口的外部访问，并检查访问日志中是否存在异常 SQL 注入请求；长期使用期间应定期备份数据库，以降低被利用造成数据泄露或篡改的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159640/WordPress-Rest-Google-Maps-SQL-Injection.html","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/auxiliary/admin/http/wp_google_maps_sqli","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?old_path=%2Fwp-google-maps&old=2061433&new_path=%2Fwp-google-maps&new=2061434&sfp_email=&sfph_mail=#file755","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-google-maps/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10692.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10692.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-10692.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-10692/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-10692.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2019-10692.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/cve-2019-10692(1).yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0037","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10647","title":"ZZZCMS zzzphp 代码注入漏洞","description":"ZZZCMS zzzphp v1.6.3 的 plugins/ueditor/php/controller.php 文件中存在代码注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，在 catchimage 功能的 source[] 参数中传入恶意 .php 文件 URL，由于 inc/zzz_file.php 文件对远程文件类型检查不严，导致攻击者能够远程执行任意 PHP 代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，可导致服务器完全被控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10647"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-30T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:11:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 zzzphp 至最新版本（v1.6.3 之后的安全版本）。如无法升级，在 `inc/zzz_file.php` 中增加对 `source[]` 参数的文件类型白名单校验，禁止直接请求 `.php` 后缀的远程文件；同时限制 `plugins/ueditor/php/controller.php` 的 `catchimage` 动作仅允许特定图片扩展名（jpg/png/gif），并配置 Web 应用防火墙拦截包含 `source[]=http` 的可疑请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kyrie403/Vuln/blob/master/zzzcms/zzzphp%20v1.6.3%20write%20file%20with%20dangerous%20type.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2019-10647.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10647.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2018/CVE-2019-10647.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10647.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/zzzcms/zzzphp/CVE-2019-10647.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-10647.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-10647.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-10647.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-10647.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-10647.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2019-10647.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0034","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10232","title":"Teclib GLPI unlock_tasks.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"Teclib GLPI 至 9.3.3 版本中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，位于 /scripts/unlock_tasks.php 文件的 \"cycle\" 参数。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，实现数据库信息窃取、数据篡改甚至获取服务器控制权。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至 9.3.4 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10232"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-27T17:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:10:32Z","remediation":"升级 GLPI 至 9.3.4 或更高版本（commit 684d4fc 已修复 /scripts/unlock_tasks.php 中 cycle 参数的 SQL 注入）。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 /scripts/unlock_tasks.php 的访问，或禁用该脚本的执行权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/glpi-project/glpi/commit/684d4fc423652ec7dde21cac4d41c2df53f56b3c","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10232.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10232.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10232.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-10232.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10232-3705.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10232-3704.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10232-3703.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10232.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-10232.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-10232.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10232.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1306","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-5418","title":"Ruby on Rails Action View 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Rails框架的Action View组件存在文件内容泄露漏洞，版本低于5.2.2.1、5.1.6.2、5.0.7.2、4.2.11.1及v3均受影响。攻击者可通过构造恶意的HTTP Accept请求头，诱导服务器读取并返回目标系统任意文件的内容。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者可借此获取服务器上的敏感配置文件、源代码等敏感信息。CVSS评分为7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-5418"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-27T14:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:37:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ruby on Rails 至以下安全版本之一：5.2.2.1、5.1.6.2、5.0.7.2 或 4.2.11.1。如暂无法立即升级，可在反向代理（如 Nginx）中过滤含 MIME 类型范围的 Accept 请求头，或通过修改配置限制 Action View 渲染文件路径，阻止任意文件读取。","status":"completed","collected_a