ofiles/Ruby on Rails CVE-2019-5418.bb","https://github.com/wagiro/BurpBounty/blob/125a093e7c4389823e25210356d05ed886f2297f/profiles/RoR_CVE-2019-5418_WAF_Bypass.bb","https://github.com/wagiro/BurpBounty/blob/125a093e7c4389823e25210356d05ed886f2297f/profiles/RoR CVE-2019-5418 WAF Bypass.bb","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-5418-4165.yaml","https://github.com/W01fh4cker/Serein","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2019-5418","https://github.com/mpgn/Rails-doubletap-RCE","https://github.com/brompwnie/CVE-2019-5418-Scanner","https://github.com/omarkurt/CVE-2019-5418"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1306.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1306.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0100","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10068","title":"Kentico CMS 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Kentico CMS 的 staging 服务存在安全头验证缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向该服务发送特制请求绕过初始认证，触发对用户可控 .NET 对象的反序列化操作，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Kentico 9.x、10.0.x（低于 10.0.52）、11.0.x（低于 11.0.48）及 12.0.x（低于 12.0.15）版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何权限或用户交互，仅需通过网络发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10068"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-03-26T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:10:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Kentico 升级至 12.0.15、11.0.48、10.0.52 或对应 9.x 修复版本，官方已修复 staging 服务对安全头的验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 staging 服务端口的未授权访问，并禁用 .NET 反序列化不受信任的输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157588/Kentico-CMS-12.0.14-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://devnet.kentico.com/download/hotfixes#securityBugs-v12","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-10068","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10068.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10068.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10068.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10068-3683.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10068-3685.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10068-3689.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-10068-3687.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10068.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Kentico CMS/CVE-2019-10068.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10068.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2019/CVE-2019-10068.json","https://github.com/cianananan/CVE-2019-10068-PoC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1609","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7609","title":"Elastic Kibana Timelion 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Kibana 的 Timelion 可视化组件中存在原型链污染导致的任意代码执行漏洞。攻击者在登录 Kibana 后，可通过向 Timelion 应用发送特制的请求，利用 JavaScript 原型链污染机制注入恶意代码，最终在服务器端以 Kibana 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Kibana 5.6.15 之前版本及 6.6.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Elastic 官方已在 6.6.1 和 5.6.15 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7609"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-03-25T19:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kibana 至 6.6.1 或 5.6.15 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 kibana.yml 中将 timelion.enabled 设为 false 以禁用 Timelion 可视化功能，同时通过防火墙/WAF 限制对 Kibana 端口的非授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/174569/Kibana-Timelion-Prototype-Pollution-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2019:2824","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:2860","https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elastic-stack-6-6-1-and-5-6-15-security-update/169077","https://www.elastic.co/community/security","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7609","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7609.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7609.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/8dd4bd11727f92bfc44a4f742b79d2d09c1f5387/web/CVE-2019-7609-kibana低于6.6.0未授权远程代码命令执行.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2019/CVE-2019-7609.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/kibana/CVE-2019-7609.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Kibana 原型链污染导致任意代码执行漏洞 CVE-2019-7609.md","https://github.com/swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings/blob/83630e74eb354db306bddd4e665f00e662c18f97/Prototype Pollution/README.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Kibana/CVE-2019-7609/CVE-2019-7609-kibana-rce.py","https://github.com/DawnFlame/POChouse/blob/f5b80965c38eb4f42133f4f458650bae5cc75b98/Kibana/CVE-2019-7609/CVE-2019-7609.py","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb